<section>
    <h2>The Q-System</h2>

    <p>Building on the Kyū unit, we developed a complete sizing system based on consistent multipliers:</p>

    <table class="table">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Level</th>
                <th>Q Value</th>
                <th>Multiplier</th>
                <th>Size (mm)</th>
                <th>Size (px)</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Q0</strong></td>
                <td>1</td>
                <td>×1</td>
                <td>0.25mm</td>
                <td>~1px</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Q1</strong></td>
                <td>160</td>
                <td>×160</td>
                <td>40mm</td>
                <td>~160px</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Q2</strong></td>
                <td>320</td>
                <td>×2</td>
                <td>80mm</td>
                <td>~320px</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Q3</strong></td>
                <td>480</td>
                <td>×3</td>
                <td>120mm</td>
                <td>~480px</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Q4</strong></td>
                <td>640</td>
                <td>×4</td>
                <td>160mm</td>
                <td>~640px</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Q5</strong></td>
                <td>800</td>
                <td>×5</td>
                <td>200mm</td>
                <td>~800px</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><strong>Q6</strong></td>
                <td>960</td>
                <td>×6</td>
                <td>240mm</td>
                <td>~960px</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <p>Each Q-level is exactly 160Q (or 40mm) larger than the previous. This creates a perfectly linear scale that's
        easy to reason about and produces harmonious relationships between sizes.</p>
</section>
